1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Crushed beneath a gray morning sky

2
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,000
Cold coffee sits untouched upon the desk

3
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:24,500
The ticking hands mock me without mercy

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,200
My heart has already gone beyond its limits

5
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,500
Strum it loud — the riff of despair!

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,500
Break the chains now and tear them apart

7
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,500
Strike it hard — your weary heartbeat

8
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:40,000
Even if you crumble, keep running on

9
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:54,200
Voices sneer, “Overtime is love,”

10
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:59,000
While the pale blue screen hides the night

11
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:04,000
Every smile’s just another mask

12
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
All I really want is to scream out loud

13
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:14,200
Now shout — shatter the silence!

14
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:16,900
Beat the ruthless drums again

15
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:19,000
Beat the ruthless drums again

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,500
Let the wild pulse break past its limit!

17
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,500
In sleepless nights, “I just want to quit...”

18
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:37,300
I whispered trembling

19
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:39,700
Yet still, I want to leave proof that I’ve lived

20
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:42,000
Etched upon the stage in fire

21
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,400
In the black screen’s reflection, my eyes

22
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:47,000
Hold a scream I can no longer hide

23
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,500
I’ll bare my fangs at these ashen days

24
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:53,500
And begin from here, right now


25
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Strum the chords of revolution

26
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,500
Let the thunder echo through the streets

27
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:01,000
Strike the forte of liberation

28
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:04,500
Go beyond the darkness, and further still!

29
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:09,000
Let your impulsive emotions howl

30
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:15,000
And resound beyond the loneliness!

